name=The American Household
id=AmericanHousehold
description=Rebalances loot toward what a 1993 Kentucky household actually owned: durable goods are near-certain and quality-variable, scarcity lives on consumables. Widens recipe tool requirements (capability, not SKU). Stocks specialized stores as real inventories. Raises vehicle spawns. Adds an optional per-building archetype x disposition system (military, canning, hunting, survivalist... crossed with never-came-home, evacuated, sheltered, looted) so every house tells you who lived there and what they did when it happened — toggle it in the sandbox options. Design doc v0.6.
